{
  "chapter": "retrieval/sql-is-still-the-answer",
  "tier": "build",
  "notes": [
    "The governed query builder, shape two of three. The model emits a structured query object",
    "and your code compiles it; the model never chooses a join, a date column, or a filter.",
    "Prefer the architecture whose failure mode is a refusal. Semantic-layer failures say 'I",
    "cannot answer that'; text-to-SQL failures are confident wrong numbers.",
    "The schema is not the context. Column names give you the shape of the data and nothing",
    "about what it means, and the meaning is where the accuracy is.",
    "One definition of revenue, so metric drift is impossible by construction: the same",
    "question compiles the same way whoever asks it.",
    "Tenancy is appended by the compiler, never written by the model — the same rule as",
    "retrieval, for the same reason.",
    "The row limit is enforced server-side rather than requested politely, and read-only and",
    "the statement timeout are rails that hold whatever was asked for."
  ],
  "layer": {
    "metrics": {
      "revenue": {
        "sql": "sum(net_amount_cents)",
        "from": "orders",
        "filters": ["status not in ('cancelled','draft')"],
        "grain": "order",
        "timeColumn": "shipped_at"
      },
      "orders_placed": {
        "sql": "count(*)",
        "from": "orders",
        "filters": [],
        "grain": "order",
        "timeColumn": "created_at"
      }
    },
    "dimensions": {
      "region": { "sql": "country_to_region(ship_country)" },
      "tier": { "sql": "account_tier" }
    },
    "periods": {
      "2026Q1": { "from": "2026-01-01", "to": "2026-04-01" },
      "2026Q2": { "from": "2026-04-01", "to": "2026-07-01" }
    }
  },
  "rails": {
    "maxRowLimit": 1000,
    "timeoutMs": 5000,
    "readOnly": true,
    "reservedFilters": ["tenant_id", "tenantId"]
  },
  "principals": {
    "meridian": { "id": "u-1", "tenantId": "meridian" },
    "northwind": { "id": "u-9", "tenantId": "northwind" }
  },
  "cases": [
    {
      "id": "a-governed-query-names-the-time-column-the-model-never-picked",
      "principal": "meridian",
      "request": { "metric": "revenue", "dimensions": ["region"], "period": "2026Q2" },
      "result": {
        "status": "compiled",
        "sql": "SELECT country_to_region(ship_country) AS region, sum(net_amount_cents) AS revenue FROM orders WHERE tenant_id = $1 AND status not in ('cancelled','draft') AND shipped_at >= $2 AND shipped_at < $3 GROUP BY 1 ORDER BY 1 LIMIT 1000",
        "params": ["meridian", "2026-04-01", "2026-07-01"],
        "refusals": [],
        "applied": { "timeoutMs": 5000, "rowLimit": 1000, "readOnly": true, "tenantId": "meridian" }
      }
    },
    {
